青いまま過ぎる前に何て願ってた
what was I wishing for before it passes by while still blue?

137
00:41:43,363 --> 00:41:46,863
見切りれなかった日も散々なのよ今なら
Even days I couldn't give up on were miserable, but now

138
00:41:46,863 --> 00:41:52,063
これもアクセントって思えた
I can think of this as an accent too.

139
00:41:53,063 --> 00:41:55,563
ひらっとさ響かせた
Fluttering, it echoed,

140
00:41:55,563 --> 00:41:59,863
心の言葉星に祈って
praying to the stars for the words in my heart.

141
00:41:59,863 --> 00:42:04,563
あの日の二人には何が言えるかな
What can I say to the two of us from that day?

142
00:42:07,563 --> 00:42:11,863
みんなの選手 今日ここで今手でいっぱい見せてください
Everyone's players, please show me plenty with your hands right here and now!

143
00:42:13,563 --> 00:42:17,263
ずっとからからに仕込んでいるんだ 僕ら心が動くことも
We've been packing it in parched all along, even our hearts moving.

144
00:42:17,563 --> 00:42:20,263
あと戻りなんてできやしないから
Because we can't turn back anymore,

145
00:42:20,263 --> 00:42:23,263
まっすぐ
straight ahead!

146
00:42:24,063 --> 00:42:28,563
僕らはドキドキにいつだって踊らされて朝を迎いちゃうような
We're always made to dance by the excitement, as if welcoming the morning,

147
00:42:28,563 --> 00:42:33,063
そんな毎日にしてずっとちっぽけなまままでいた
making every day like that, staying tiny all along.

148
00:42:36,063 --> 00:42:39,563
すぐのねはまだ止まらない
My immediate tears still won't stop.

149
00:42:40,063 --> 00:42:43,563
パッパッパッ 弾けてさぁ パッパッパッ 走ってさぁ
Pa-pa-pa, bursting, pa-pa-pa, running,

150
00:42:43,563 --> 00:42:49,063
たたたたんだある声もやもやもせくのもふせて
stumbling, voices, hazy feelings, hiding the impatience.

151
00:42:50,063 --> 00:42:53,063
君もそのままで描いていて
You too, keep drawing just as you are.

152
00:42:53,563 --> 00:43:00,063
ずっと夜桜ピンクの花無用に僕ら息を切らし
Always like cherry blossom pink flowers breathlessly running out,

153
00:43:01,063 --> 00:43:05,563
遊びのモード全開さ咲かせてみたいな
play mode wide open, I want to make it bloom.

154
00:43:05,563 --> 00:43:11,063
汗ばむこともカラカモ追い越すのきっとそれくらいでいいの
Sweating it out, overtaking the thirst, surely that's enough.

155
00:43:12,063 --> 00:43:16,863
今は何をもたもくずに続けて
Now, without hesitating, continuing,

156
00:43:16,863 --> 00:43:22,063
さぁ行こうハイハイハイハイ
now let's go, hi, hi, hi, hi!

157
00:43:42,263 --> 00:43:45,063
というわけで始まりました！
And so, it has begun!

158
00:43:45,063 --> 00:43:49,063
ももすずねねファーストライブ「たなか」！
Momosuzu Nene's 1st Live 'Tanaka'!

159
00:43:49,063 --> 00:43:51,563
超開会！
Super opening!

160
00:43:59,063 --> 00:44:05,063
じゃあまずねねの自己紹介をさせていただきたいと思います！
Now first, if you'll allow me to introduce myself!

161
00:44:05,063 --> 00:44:08,563
ねねがみんなの心のって言ったら
When Nene says 'everyone's heart',

162
00:44:08,563 --> 00:44:14,563
みんななんて返すんだっけ？
what do you guys reply with?

163
00:44:15,563 --> 00:44:19,563
その通りよくできました！じゃあいくよ！
Spot on, well done! Alright, here we go!

164
00:44:19,563 --> 00:44:24,063
ホロライブネポラボのね！みんなの心の！
Hololive's Nepolabo's Ne! Everyone's heart's!

165
00:44:25,063 --> 00:44:29,063
待ちに待ったファーストライブ！
Long-awaited 1st Live!

166
00:44:29,563 --> 00:44:38,063
今回のテーマは楽しさ最大出力！をテーマにねねがみんなと一緒に超開化していくっていうライブにしていきたいと思ってます！
This time's theme is maximum fun output! Nene wants to make this a live where we all open up together!

167
00:44:42,563 --> 00:44:52,563
普通のライブと違って、みんなが参加してめちゃくちゃ楽しめるようにね、いっぱいワクワクとかドキドキを持ってきたから、みんな楽しみにしててね！
Unlike a regular live, since everyone participates and can enjoy it like crazy, I brought lots of excitement and thrills, so look forward to it!

168
00:44:55,063 --> 00:44:59,563
そしてねねのファーストアルバム「Pekochu Story」、みんな聞いてくれた？
And everyone, have you listened to Nene's 1st album 'Pekochu Story'?

169
00:45:02,943 --> 00:45:06,263
いいね もうなんかタオルがちょっと汗ばんでる人がいるくない？
Goodness, aren't there some people whose towels are already a bit sweaty?

170
00:45:07,523 --> 00:45:10,663
みんな、どの曲が好きだった？ せーの！
Everyone, which song did you like best? Ready, go!

171
00:45:13,313 --> 00:45:15,623
おーおーおー ちょっと待って、そっちの人
Oh, oh, oh... Wait a second, you guys over there—

172
00:45:16,223 --> 00:45:17,733
な、な、なに、なに、何が好き？
Wh-wh-what, what, what do you like?

173
00:45:19,543 --> 00:45:21,023
全部？ 全部！ こっち、こっちの人は？
Everything? Everything! How about you guys over here?

174
00:45:23,033 --> 00:45:26,623
全部、全部か！ ねえねも全部好きでーす！
Everything, everything? Nene loves everything too!

175
00:45:29,123 --> 00:45:36,273
ありがとう！ そして今回はガールズバンドの生演奏でお届けしていきます！ご紹介をさせてください！
Thank you! And this time, we're delivering the performance with a live girls' band! Please let me introduce them!

176
00:45:37,153 --> 00:45:40,883
キーボードでバンドマスターのシーリィホさん！
On keyboard and band master, Cley-Ho!

177
00:45:45,443 --> 00:45:51,653
そしてギターのリーツマ・リオンさん！
And on guitar, Reatsuma Marion!

178
00:45:51,953 --> 00:45:58,413
そしてベースのアイビー・ベイダーさん！
And on bass, Ivy Bader!

179
00:45:58,703 --> 00:46:05,203
ドラムのパンダ・ナナコさんです！
And on drums, Panda Nanako!

180
00:46:05,893 --> 00:46:24,573
はい、そしてちょっとね配信の方にも触れていきたいと思うんですけど、みんなコメントいっぱいありがとう！このへんにね あの配信の人が見ているカメラがあるの。えーい！みなさんいっぱいスクショ撮ってね！
Yes, and I'd also like to touch on the stream. Thank you all so much for all the comments! There's a camera right around here for the viewers watching the stream. Yay! Everyone, take lots of screenshots!

181
00:46:24,893 --> 00:46:37,413
そして今回のライブの感想とかはね、全部ハッシュタグ もも、あ、違う、ちゃん、ね、ハッシュタグねね超会歌でたくさんポストしてください！
And please post your thoughts on this live using the hashtag #NeneChouKaika!

182
00:46:38,333 --> 00:46:54,753
そして今YouTubeそしてTikTokでご覧の方は次の曲まで聴けるので、まだまだ一緒に盛り上がりたーいって人は概要欄から配信サイトへGOしてください！
And for those watching on YouTube and TikTok, you can listen up to the next song, so if you want to keep getting hyped up together, go to the streaming site via the description box!

183
00:46:56,673 --> 00:47:11,913
さあみんな、始まる前からギラファンねね症出そうしてたけど、まだライブ始まってたった2曲だからね！ってことで次の曲いこうかな！次は少ししっとりめの曲から聴いてください。
Now everyone, you were already getting all hyped up even before it started, but the live has only just begun after two songs! So let's move on to the next song! Next, please listen to a slightly more sentimental song.

184
00:47:24,579 --> 00:47:29,879
覚えてるかな？
Do you remember?

185
00:47:29,879 --> 00:47:34,579
桜色に染まった
Dyed in cherry blossom pink,

186
00:47:34,579 --> 00:47:37,579
帰り道の途中
along the way home.

187
00:47:37,579 --> 00:47:43,779
流れてくる春のふきだまりを歩きながら
Walking through drifts of spring breeze,

188
00:47:43,779 --> 00:47:48,779
少し背伸びしていた 変わらない距離感を
standing on my tiptoes, wishing to close

189
00:47:48,779 --> 00:47:51,579
本当は縮めたくて
the unchanging distance between us.

190
00:47:51,579 --> 00:47:54,079
言えなくて
Unable to say it,

191
00:47:54,079 --> 00:47:56,579
言わなくて
choosing not to say it,

192
00:47:56,579 --> 00:48:00,079
「またね」じゃ足りないよ
"See you later" isn't enough.

193
00:48:00,079 --> 00:48:04,579
いつかまた会えるかな？
Will we meet again someday?

194
00:48:04,579 --> 00:48:11,079
君と何回だって 何回だって 笑い合えた春の日
The spring days we laughed together, over and over,

195
00:48:11,079 --> 00:48:15,079
風に舞ってふわり消えた それでも忘れない
danced on the wind and faded away, yet I won't forget.

196
00:48:15,079 --> 00:48:22,079
ほぐれた手と手 離れていく 言葉を探していた
Hands untangling and pulling apart, as I searched for words.

197
00:48:22,079 --> 00:48:26,579
淡く揺れてとけた想い それでも忘れない
Feelings that gently swayed and melted away, yet I won't forget.

198
00:48:26,579 --> 00:48:30,079
さようならではなく ありがとう
Not goodbye, but thank you.

199
00:48:30,079 --> 00:48:33,579
言葉をつなげて
Piecing words together,

200
00:48:33,579 --> 00:48:37,079
胸の奥にしまった
I tucked them deep inside my heart.

201
00:48:37,079 --> 00:48:41,079
あどけない気持ち
Innocent feelings,

202
00:48:41,079 --> 00:48:45,079
本当は伝えたくて
truly wanting to convey them.

203
00:48:45,079 --> 00:48:48,079
届けたい 届かない
Wanting to reach you, yet out of reach,

204
00:48:48,079 --> 00:48:51,079
「またね」じゃ足りないけど
"See you later" isn't enough, but

205
00:48:51,079 --> 00:48:54,079
いつかまた会えるかな？
will we meet again someday?

206
00:48:54,079 --> 00:49:02,079
君と何回だって 何回だって 見上げた空の色も
The color of the sky we looked up at together, over and over,

207
00:49:02,079 --> 00:49:08,079
風に乗ってヒラリ飛んだ 花びらの色も
and the color of petals fluttering on the wind.

208
00:49:08,079 --> 00:49:12,579
これから描く未来地図 魔法みたいに染めて
Dyeing the future map we'll draw from now on like magic—

209
00:49:12,579 --> 00:49:17,579
きっとそこに君はいない 明日だとしても
even if tomorrow you won't be there.

210
00:49:17,579 --> 00:49:22,079
今も色褪せない記憶 写真みたいに色付いて
Memories that still haven't faded, colorful like photos,

211
00:49:22,079 --> 00:49:26,579
ずーっとずーっと思い出達 春の匂いがした
all our memories together always smelled of spring.

212
00:49:26,579 --> 00:49:33,579
君と何回だって 何回だって 笑い合えた春の日
The spring days we laughed together, over and over,

213
00:49:33,579 --> 00:49:37,579
風に舞ってふわり消えた それでも忘れない
danced on the wind and faded away, yet I won't forget.

214
00:49:37,579 --> 00:49:44,579
ほぐれた手と手 離れていく 言葉を探していた
Hands untangling and pulling apart, as I searched for words.

215
00:49:44,579 --> 00:49:48,579
淡く揺れてとけた想い それでも忘れない
Feelings that gently swayed and melted away, yet I won't forget.

216
00:49:48,579 --> 00:49:52,079
さようならではなく ありがとう
Not goodbye, but thank you.

217
00:50:00,321 --> 00:50:01,991
花びらの色も
The color of the petals too,

218
00:50:02,781 --> 00:50:06,071
これから描く未来地図
The future map we'll draw from now on

219
00:50:06,281 --> 00:50:09,211
魔法みたいに染めて
Dyed like magic,

220
00:50:09,401 --> 00:50:13,331
きっとそこに君はいない
Surely you won't be there,

221
00:50:13,531 --> 00:50:16,951
明日だとしても
Even if it's tomorrow.

222
00:50:17,161 --> 00:50:19,561
今も今も
Now too, now too,

223
00:50:19,561 --> 00:50:21,901
あせない記憶
Unfading memories.

224
00:50:22,001 --> 00:50:25,211
写真みたいに色付いて
Colored like a photograph,

225
00:50:25,211 --> 00:50:28,261
ずっとずっと想い出達
Memories on and on,

226
00:50:28,361 --> 00:50:30,441
ハーモニー響いた
Harmonizing into the night.

227
00:50:30,501 --> 00:50:33,301
君となんだって何だって
Whatever it was with you,

228
00:50:33,601 --> 00:50:36,601
笑い合えた春の日
The spring days we shared a laugh.

229
00:50:37,901 --> 00:50:41,151
君となんだって何だって
Whatever it was with you,

230
00:50:41,251 --> 00:50:43,301
なんだって
Whatever it was...

231
00:50:44,001 --> 00:50:47,401
笑い合えた春の日
The spring days we shared a laugh,

232
00:50:47,401 --> 00:50:50,901
風に揺れてふわり消えた
Fluttering in the wind and fading away.

233
00:50:51,101 --> 00:50:55,301
それでも忘れない
Even so, I won't forget.

234
00:50:55,897 --> 00:51:00,097
ほどけた手と手離れてゆく
Hands parting ways that were once clasped,

235
00:51:00,701 --> 00:51:04,201
言葉を探していた
I was searching for words.

236
00:51:04,301 --> 00:51:07,851
淡く揺れてとけた想い
Faintly swaying and dissolving feelings,

237
00:51:08,101 --> 00:51:10,601
それでも忘れない
Even so, I won't forget.

238
00:51:11,301 --> 00:51:14,351
さよならじゃなくて
Not a goodbye, but...

239
00:51:14,351 --> 00:51:18,951
ありがとう
Thank you.

240
00:51:32,001 --> 00:51:36,901
生まれたてのドキドキを響かせてよ
Let the newborn heartbeat resonate!

